00:02:32.000 --> 00:02:49.000
They wanted to renovate those houses, they wanted to provide those as affordable housing, they wanted to invite people who previously had lived in that neighbor but had to be moved away from it. They wanted to invite those people back in. Lewis is a part of a design collective called Assemble. And with Assemble's support,
他们想翻新这些房子，想把它们作为经济适用房提供出来，他们想邀请以前住在那个街区但不得不搬走的人回来。他们想把那些人请回来。路易斯是Assemble设计集体的一员。在Assemble的支持下，

