far, far away from Rome, and it's very chaotic, and there's no stability at the top. Meanwhile, the empire's neighbors were watching this political instability and they're thinking, hey, there's an opportunity here. Everybody around the outside of the empire thinks this is a great time to try and have a go at taking some land for themselves. You start to get non-Roman peoples trying to get inside the empire. Then a pandemic hit. It was called the Plague of the Cyprian and it was horrific. For almost 20 years, it ripped through the empire. Some scholars now think it was a virus similar to Ebola.
地点远在罗马之外，情况非常混乱，高层毫无稳定性。与此同时，帝国的邻居们看到了这种政治不稳定，心想，嘿，这里有机遇。帝国周边所有的人都认为这是一个尝试为自己夺取一些土地的好时机。你开始看到非罗马人试图进入帝国境内。接着是一场大流行病。被称为西普里安瘟疫，极其恐怖。持续了近20年，肆虐整个帝国。一些学者现在认为这是一种类似于埃博拉的病毒。

